    "No layout, public signature, compiler flag, mapping extent or arbitrary buffer-size changes. No raw-address, assembler, vtable or receiver-offset substitutions. Expand scope centrally for new structural discoveries.",
    "Use existing actual-source category behavior and mutant controls. Measure all Datalink identities after a candidate; inspect physical collateral and compile/link before coordinator-reviewed integration. Record new exact bodies only through the native recorder; preserve all historical obligations."
  ],
